   3:src/core/selftest_tasks.c **** // Every expectation mirrors observable behavior of Source/core/tasks.lua
   4:src/core/selftest_tasks.c **** // captured via the host-Lua oracle (p05_oracle.lua -> p05_truth.txt):
   5:src/core/selftest_tasks.c **** // immediate-done timing, 500ms/64-iteration budget gating (+20ms/iter ->
